  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/006771b9f7ae321438e7a68b16f53e90db3c3f96a3a6990265d3b29dd3f68a2a.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** 24 and 48, × and ÷\n\nGiven:\n\n24 ÷ 16 - 96 + 48 × 12 = 195\n\nAfter interchange the numbers and signs;\n\n48 × 16 - 96 + ***__24 __******__÷ 12__*** = 195\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n***__48 __******__× 16__*** - 96 + 2 = 195\n\n***__768__*** - 96 ***__+ 2__*** = 195\n\n***__770 – 96__*** = 195\n\n674 = 195 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 :** 24 and 16, - and ÷\n\nGiven: \n\n24 ÷ 16 - 96 + 48 × 12 = 195\n\nAfter interchange the numbers and signs;\n\n16 - ***__24 __******__÷ 96__*** + 48 × 12 = 195\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n16 – 0.25 + ***__48 × 12__*** = 195\n\n***__16__*** – 0.25 ***__+ 576__*** = 195\n\n***__592 – 0.25__*** = 195\n\n591.75 = 195 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: **12 and 16, × and ÷\n\n**Given:**\n\n**24 ÷ 16 - 96 + 48 × 12 = 195**\n\n**After interchange the numbers and signs;**\n\n**24 ****× 12 - 96 + *__48 __**__÷ 16__* = 195**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n***__24 __******__× 12__***** - 96 + 3 = 195**\n\n***__288__***** – 96 *__+ 3__* = 195**\n\n***__291 – 96__***** = 195**\n\n**195 = 195** **(LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 4: **12 and 48, × and +\n\nGiven:\n\n24 ÷ 16 - 96 + 48 × 12 = 195\n\nAfter interchange the numbers and signs;\n\n***__24 ÷ 16__*** - 96 × 12 + 48 = 195\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n1.5 – ***__96 __******__× 12__*** + 48 = 195\n\n***__1.5 __***– 1152 ***__+ 48__*** = 195\n\n***__49.5 – 1152 __***= 195\n\n- 1102.5 = 195 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****12 and 16, × and ÷”.**",
